---@field persona? aws.bedrock_agent.RetrievalInstructionFieldText|distilled.Secret Who the assistant is: identity, tone and language.
---@field answerFormat? aws.bedrock_agent.RetrievalInstructionFieldText|distilled.Secret How the answer is structured, including how sources are cited.
---@field answerPolicy? aws.bedrock_agent.RetrievalInstructionFieldText|distilled.Secret Whether and how to answer: how strongly an answer must be supported, and what to do with questions outside scope.

---A description of a retrieval instruction.
---@alias aws.bedrock_agent.RetrievalInstructionDescription string

---One reason the most recent create or update did not succeed. code drives programmatic branching (fix the text, fix the configuration, or retry); message carries the specific cause.
---@class aws.bedrock_agent.RetrievalInstructionFailureReason
---@field fieldName? aws.bedrock_agent.RetrievalInstructionFieldName The instruction field this entry is about. Present on review rejections of a specific field; absent when the failure applies to the whole review, because a client-side execution failure or a service fault has no single field.
---@field code aws.bedrock_agent.RetrievalInstructionFailureReasonCode Stable, machine-readable classification by fault attribution. Valid values:
---@field message string Human-readable explanation of the specific cause. Never contains the customer's own text.

---A machine-readable failure classification. See RetrievalInstructionFailureReason.code for the value semantics.
---@alias aws.bedrock_agent.RetrievalInstructionFailureReasonCode "CONTENT_REJECTED"|"CLIENT_ERROR"|"INTERNAL_ERROR"

---Why the most recent create or update did not succeed: one entry per rejected field (CONTENT_REJECTED, with fieldName), or a single entry for a whole-review failure (CLIENT_ERROR or INTERNAL_ERROR, without fieldName). Present only when lastTransitionStatus is CREATE_FAILED or UPDATE_FAILED.
---@alias aws.bedrock_agent.RetrievalInstructionFailureReasons aws.bedrock_agent.RetrievalInstructionFailureReason[]

---Identifies one field of RetrievalInstructionContent:
---@alias aws.bedrock_agent.RetrievalInstructionFieldName "RETRIEVAL_GUIDANCE"|"PERSONA"|"ANSWER_FORMAT"|"ANSWER_POLICY"

---The text of a single retrieval instruction field.
---@alias aws.bedrock_agent.RetrievalInstructionFieldText string

---The identifier of a retrieval instruction.
---@alias aws.bedrock_agent.RetrievalInstructionId string

---The outcome or in-progress state of the most recent create or update of a retrieval instruction. Delete is synchronous and has no representation here. Independent of RetrievalInstructionStatus.
---@alias aws.bedrock_agent.RetrievalInstructionLastTransitionStatus "CREATING"|"UPDATING"|"CREATE_SUCCESSFUL"|"CREATE_FAILED"|"UPDATE_SUCCESSFUL"|"UPDATE_FAILED"

---The maximum number of items to return in a single page of ListRetrievalInstructions or ListRetrievalInstructionVersions. The effective upper bound is enforced service-side; the model constrains only to a positive value.
