---@field lastTransitionStatus aws.bedrock_agent.RetrievalInstructionLastTransitionStatus The outcome or in-progress state of the most recent create or update of the retrieval instruction.
---@field createdAt aws.bedrock_agent.DateTimestamp When you created the retrieval instruction.
---@field updatedAt aws.bedrock_agent.DateTimestamp When the retrieval instruction was last updated.
---@field description? distilled.Secret A description of the retrieval instruction.

